  "description": "\"I, Evelyn Palace, will step down as Empress. By choice.\" The imperial court bound by rules, and her perfect yet cold husband, Fabian. Evelyn closed her eyes in solitude the year she passed thirty, and when she opened them again… she found herself back at twenty. Before Evelyn, who chose freedom while holding the most precious person in the world within her, the bond she thought had been cleanly severed began to burn fiercely once again.",
